      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Exactly, it's very frustrating as a disabled person, this was my only way to play in VR. I have very limited functionality in my arms and hands. Using a gamepad or DS4 was the only way I could enjoy VR with my headset. I imagine it is a larger accessibility issue if you cannot use alternative methods while in VR other than the motion controllers which a lot of people cannot use. there is a lot of games that are off limits for disabled people because accessibility just isn't considered , but what is sad about this one is that accessibility options were removed.",
