  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "After the 2024.3.1 Release, Xbox controller support while in VR mode broke, it is now impossible to interact with menus and buttons, previously you could look at a button then select it with the Xbox controller while in VR mode. This is now impossible as the expression menu spawns on the floor, and is immovable and the main menu can no longer be interacted with.",
